MODULE: DriveResidencyBoundedBudgetNeverAbandons
TARGET: DriveResidencyBounded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the last drive-budget opportunity leaves hung drive work holding a permit
PERTURBS: BudgetOpportunity

--- FIND
          THEN AbandonOnBudget(r)
--- REPLACE
          THEN /\ holdLeft' = [holdLeft EXCEPT ![r] = 0]
               /\ UNCHANGED <<holders, free, withheld, queue, status, role, observed,
                   pressure, pressurePhase, drain, hung, deadline, frontier, banked,
                   checkpoint, holes, ledger, arrivalsClosed, dispatchEpoch,
                   clientActive, cancelled>>
--- END
